# Check for error message
self.assertIn("All fields are required", self.driver.page_source)
```

**Error Message:**
```
AssertionError: 'All fields are required' not found in...
```

**Analysis:**
- The test attempts to add an item without a name (clearing the item name field). The expected behavior is that the application would prevent this submission and display an error message stating that "All fields are required".
