 with current wishlist\n   END FUNCTION\n   ```\n', '|Case|:**login**\n   ```pseudocode\n   FUNCTION login_page()\n       RENDER login.html\n   END FUNCTION\n\n   FUNCTION login()\n       username = request.form[\'username\']\n       password = request.form[\'password\']\n       \n       IF user_manager.login(username, password)\n           session[\'username\'] = username\n           REDIRECT to \'/dashboard\'\n       ELSE\n           RETURN "Login failed", 400\n       ENDIF\n\n   FUNCTION dashboard()\n       IF \'username\' NOT IN session\n           REDIRECT to \'/\'\n       ENDIF\n       \n       wishlist_items = wishlist_manager.view_wishlist(session[\'username\'])\n       RENDER dashboard.html WITH items = wishlist_items\n   END FUNCTION\n   ```\n|Case|:**data_persistence**\n   ```pseudocode\n   CLASS UserManager:\n       FUNCTION __init__(filename):\n           SET self.filename = filename\n           CALL self.load_users()\n\n       FUNCTION load_users():\n           INITIALIZE self.users as DICTIONARY\n           IF file exists at self.filename:\n               OPEN file for reading as file:\n                   FOR each line in file:\n                       SPLIT line by \'|\'\n                       ASSIGN username and password\n                       SET self.users[username] = password\n\n       FUNCTION register(username, password):\n           IF username in self.users:\n               RETURN False\n           SET self.users[username] = password\n           OPEN file at self.filename for appending as file:\n               WRITE f"{username}|{password}\\n" to file\n           RETURN True\n           \n       FUNCTION login(username, password):\n           RETURN self.users.get(username) == password\n\n   CLASS WishlistManager:\n       FUNCTION __init__(filename):\n           SET self.filename = filename\n           CALL self.load_items()\n\n       FUNCTION load_items():\n           INITIALIZE self.items as LIST\n           IF file exists at self.filename